Third-party assets and licences

Status (2026-10-01): no third-party artwork is used in the product, and no third-party sheet is committed. Two review images in docs/designs/ are derived from a CC0 sprite (see below). The product art is drawn in this repository. The packs below were inspected in Phase 0 and are listed only so their provenance is not lost; none is shipped. The one third-party asset that ships is the IBM Plex Sans font, listed at the end with its licence text (task 1.2). Add real entries here, with licence text, when anything else third-party is added.

Committed derivative images (review evidence only, not shipped in the app):
   docs/designs/phase-0-recolor-sheet.png and docs/designs/phase-0-scale-50.png are
   recolored, enlarged or shrunk copies of one frame of the Hormelz sprite below (CC0 1.0,
   so no attribution is required; recorded here for provenance).
   docs/designs/mockup-room-variant-a.jpg is an AI-generated mockup made for this project,
   not derived from any third-party artwork.

Inspected, not used in the product:

1. Hormelz, "8 Directional 2D Businessman Character"
   https://hormelz.itch.io/8-directional-2d-businessman-character
   Licence: CC0 1.0, as stated on the itch.io page (no licence file was read).
   Inspected 2026-10-01 (Walk, Idle, Talking, Carrying).

2. Kenney, "Furniture Kit" 2.0
   https://kenney.nl/assets/furniture-kit
   Licence: CC0, from License.txt inside the zip (read).
